OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers seek help with
OL,4,A'significant burden' of bluetongue
OL,5,Arestrictions
OL,6,
OL,7,FA farming union has called on the
OL,8,FScottish government to provide support
OL,9,Ffor livestock farmers affected by
OL,10,Frestrictions aimed at stopping the
OL,11,Fspread of the bluetongue virus.
OL,13,FA temporary control zone (TCZ) limiting
OL,14,Fmovement covers much of Dumfries and
OL,15,FGalloway and parts of Ayrshire.
OL,17,FNFU Scotland president Andrew Connon
OL,18,Fsaid farmers in the area were being
OL,19,Fasked to carry a "significant burden"
OL,20,Fto protect the country's wider
OL,21,Flivestock industry.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
