OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers seek help with
OL,4,A'significant burden' of bluetongue
OL,5,Arestrictions
OL,6,
OL,7,FAgriculture Minister Jim Fairlie said
OL,8,Fhe understood it was a "concerning
OL,9,Ftime" for farmers - particularly in the
OL,10,Fcontrol zone - and the Scottish
OL,11,Fgovernment would consider the points
OL,12,Fraised.
